== Usage ==
A highlighted section for a tower article, such as notes about its gameplay or development history.

<pre>
{{Tower info section
 | title = Notes
 | text = Add verified information here.
}}
</pre>

Parameters:
* `title` — optional heading; defaults to “Tower information”.
* `text` — the content displayed in the section.

Copy this source into `Template:Tower info section` on the target wiki and test it in a sandbox.
